<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37004" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pondĕrōsus</span></b> , a,
		um, adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of great</i>
			
			<i>weight</i>, <i>weighty</i>, <i>heavy</i>, <i>ponderous.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">compedes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Capt. 3, 5, 64</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">frumentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 52 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verbera,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 1, 8</span></i>
			
			<i>fin.—Comp.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lana ponderosior,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 21, 17, 67, §
				107</span></i>.—<i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ponderosissimi lapides,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					36, 19, 30, § 138</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ponderosa epistola,</span>”
				<i>weighty</i>, <i>significant</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 2, 11, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vox,</span>”
				<i>weighty</i>, <i>imposing</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Val.
					Max. 6, 4, 1</span></i>
			
			<i>ext.</i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
